    "turn_text": "Very when they have a ton of veterans in those programs. That's why I say it's like I'm not really joking all that much. I say it's got a common thing for seals and seal officers, especially to do is I didn't wear my politics on my sleeve and it'd be kind of outward way that I do now. But I have gone back to speak. I've gone back to speak in the classes of some mild professors and it's been good. And if somebody has some bad to say they've kept themselves, they might know my reputation too, which is to, I don't take anything lying down or I'm always ready. But I'm also pretty rational, I think, and maybe that garner some respect. So I've been received just fine when I've gone back and at the time.",
