    "turn_text": "Well, there's a fisher in your own party on the issue of Ukraine and what the role of the U.S. should be. And there are strong proponents of both views. The president certainly, Senator Vance, are on, it seemed to be on one side of this. Tell me, articulate the other point of view, because I know you hold it. as to why we should be steadfast on the issue of drawing the line on Russia.",
